5, according to the TV station KPMH . The demonstration was organized with the help of the nonprofit FireWERX and the California-based company Seneca , which is making the drones commercially available starting in 2026. Read full article Commentsƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;82ZxYgoYtt7BFoaIlH4b-2HLwaaFlpUGSbVO3OcWZSAƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxIFirefighting drones in the works as wildfires plague US nearly year-roundƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;D7tuRQn-495J_Vnzq-57Gl52Mj0hgms1vEdxifBQnJIƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkoSyndicationItemƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;NwraTK1IEOhYBH3H8WPabLsveLYik1y_o_D7CAaw0_sƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxmhttps://arstechnica.com/ai/2026/07/firefighting-drones-in-the-works-as-wildfires-plague-us-nearly-year-round/ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;kHid26xC7F80C07KEbsNRbKLFV38o5wzqLmN_RSFWXIƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxIfirefighting-drones-in-the-works-as-wildfires-plague-us-nearly-year-roundƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;hweKvDu46r9DpvTQ9KHK4Cg9P_ixu2Ao9BLR_qV_Tscƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkwSyndicationSourceBundleƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;scTlQAgtR8_6_M93FB6N36_HwJYGTPLO9-MIpCiSrJkƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkjtechnologyƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;-OuMAUghSW-HRxHoQzbQCg-QDvfucrYwMdMQ0pxuUJ0ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;WYrh2GXwUWOsYxqYM6MUPhOU4pee0LrNUqoNB2MKwNQƒdpairƒhcon